    "agent_last_message": "Implemented the complete tool in [output/main.js](/workspace/output/main.js).\n\nIt supports:\n\n- `--input <path>`\n- `--output <path>`\n\nBehavior implemented per spec:\n\n- Counts `lines` (newline-terminated lines plus final non-newline line)\n- Counts `words` using only whitespace delimiters: space, tab, newline, carriage return, form feed, vertical tab\n- Counts `characters` as raw byte length\n- Counts `unique_words` case-insensitively (lowercased)\n- Returns `top_words` (up to 10), sorted by:\n1. `count` descending\n2. `word` ascending lexicographic\n\nExit codes implemented:\n\n- `0`: success\n- `1`: invalid invocation / bad args / unreadable input / malformed UTF-8 input\n- `2`: unexpected internal error\n\nValidation run locally on Node `v22.22.2` against spec edge cases (empty file, no trailing newline, trailing newline, whitespace-only, case-insensitivity, top-10/tie ordering), plus exit-code checks.",
